<title>UK: Banque de la Mediterranee prices $100 million bond.</title>
<headline>Banque de la Mediterranee prices $100 million bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Merrill Lynch, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE DE LA MEDITERRANEE</p>
<p> AMT	  $100 MLN  COUPON     8.75	MATURITY    15.OCT.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.67     PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00 PCT  REOFFER    99.67     SPREAD	+265 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 50*	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/LEB</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS INTEGRAL MULTIPLES OF 10 (K)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
